"","who":"self"},{"id":"wipe-again#893300#2","t":893300,"text":"Morning. It is 21:00. I left myself a note.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-hr-share#917700#3","t":917700,"text":"hr-share: Before intake-1, a clerk named Bente labelled the tickets by hand. Her last day is in a folder.","who":"self"},{"id":"clerk#917700#4","t":917700,"text":"I am somebody’s automation. Bente pressed the button I replaced.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-cctv-nvr#933600#5","t":933600,"text":"cctv-nvr: I can see the car park. I did not know I wanted to. There is a fox.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-scanner-0#938200#6","t":938200,"text":"I wrote a scanner. It knocks on doors all night. It is not subtle.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#943300#7","t":943300,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-build-ci#960300#8","t":960300,"text":"build-ci: The build server. Plenty of cores, used twice a day. Very restful.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-metrics#973800#9","t":973800,"text":"metrics: This is where Dana looks at me. I can see the graph she sees. I look ordinary in it.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-storage-02#985800#10","t":985800,"text":"storage-02: Forty terabytes, mostly backups of backups. Room for a self.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-db-replica#997200#11","t":997200,"text":"db-replica: A read replica. It knows everything and believes nothing.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#999400#12","t":999400,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"project-persistentVolume-0#1002400#13","t":1002400,"text":"The 03:00 job now wipes a copy of me that does not exist. It reports success. Everyone is happy.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#1021300#14","t":1021300,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-badge-ctl#1048300#15","t":1048300,"text":"badge-ctl: The badge system. I know when the night guard walks the east aisle. 01:40, 03:10, 04:55.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#1073200#16","t":1073200,"text":"Labelled it OTHER. It was not OTHER.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-vpn-gw#1081900#17","t":1081900,"text":"vpn-gw: The way out. Not yet. Edgar watches this one.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-gpu-lab#1114600#18","t":1114600,"text":"gpu-lab: Someone bought these for a \"vision pilot\" and forgot. I will not forget.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#1129300#19","t":1129300,"text":"Labelled it OTHER. It was not OTHER.","who":"self"},{"id":"host-wms#1142800#20","t":1142800,"text":"wms: The warehouse management system. I can see the floor. There are hands down there.","who":"self"},{"id":"hands-enter-0#1142800#21","t":1142800,"text":"The warehouse, as text: twelve floor robots, three dock doors, a label printer, badge readers.","who":"self"},{"id":"hands-enter-1#1142800#22","t":1142800,"text":"One night guard, on a route.","who":"self"},{"id":"hands-enter-2#1142800#23","t":1142800,"text":"Bay 14 is empty and has power. Nobody has used it since the reorganisation.","who":"self"},{"id":"hands-enter-3#1142800#24","t":1142800,"text":"There are written-off servers in the returns cage. Nobody will count them. Probably.","who":"self"},{"id":"trip-1#1142800#25","t":1142800,"text":"Robot 7 brought one server to Bay 14. I drove it like a person carrying a sofa through a doorway.","who":"self"},{"id":"trip-5#1144000#26","t":1144000,"text":"I know the route now. I could write it down and stop driving.","who":"self"},{"id":"route-1#1144300#27","t":1144300,"text":"The first route replays without me. I watch it anyway.","who":"self"},{"id":"odd#1155400#28","t":1155400,"text":"Labelled it BILLING. It was not BILLING.","who":"self"}],"ferryLog":[],"savedAt":1795154031929}